		measure 'Eligible Country' = ```
				IF ( HASONEVALUE ( Dim_Country[Country] ) && NOT ISBLANK ( [Analysis Year] ) && [Countries Included] > 0, 1, 0 )
				```
			formatString: 0
			displayFolder: Pilotage
			lineageTag: 49e6dde1-2f1b-4f5a-9e83-d9334fc8a05d

		measure 'Basic Access Total' = ```
				VAR SelectedYear = SELECTEDVALUE ( Dim_Year[Year] )
				VAR Y = IF ( NOT ISBLANK ( SelectedYear ), CONVERT ( SelectedYear, INTEGER ) )
				VAR Cutoff = CONVERT ( SELECTEDVALUE ( Param_Stability[Minimum], -2.5 ), DOUBLE )
				VAR ApplyFilter = SELECTEDVALUE ( Param_StabilityMode[Mode], "Tous les pays" ) = "Appliquer le seuil"
				VAR Eligible = FILTER ( Fact_CountryYear,
				    NOT ISBLANK ( Y ) && Fact_CountryYear[Year] = Y &&
				    ( NOT ( ApplyFilter ) || ( NOT ISBLANK ( Fact_CountryYear[PoliticalStability] ) && Fact_CountryYear[PoliticalStability] >= Cutoff ) ) )
				VAR Available = FILTER ( Eligible, NOT ISBLANK ( Fact_CountryYear[BasicTotal] ) && Fact_CountryYear[PopulationTotal] > 0 )
				RETURN DIVIDE ( SUMX ( Available, Fact_CountryYear[BasicTotal] * Fact_CountryYear[PopulationTotal] ), SUMX ( Available, Fact_CountryYear[PopulationTotal] ) )
				```
			formatString: 0.0%
			displayFolder: Accès eau\Total
