		measure 'Access Health Profile Score' = ```
				VAR Access = [Basic Access Total]
				VAR Mortality = [Mortality Rate Weighted]
				RETURN IF ( HASONEVALUE ( Dim_Country[Country] ) && NOT ISBLANK ( Access ) && NOT ISBLANK ( Mortality ),
				    50 * Access + 50 * ( 1 - MIN ( DIVIDE ( Mortality, 100 ), 1 ) ) )
				```
